# Copy to .env at the repo root and fill in. .env is git-ignored and kept out of every Docker image; never commit a real key.
# The OpenAI (GPT) API key, for the research tools run on this server only (owner, 2 Nov 2026): never passed to the
# live Shuk container. Read from process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY; never with a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix, which would ship it to
# every browser. Never used for scoring (D8: no AI scoring).
OPENAI_API_KEY=change-me
# OPENAI_MODEL=model-id-from-the-openai-models-page
